[ATTACH=full]677661[/ATTACH]
[/CENTER]
[FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Minecraft Calendar continuation of the old [URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/thetime-the-custom-calendar.25146/']TheTime[/URL] plugin.

The plugin is now paid for the people who want to support me and get something in return as well.

The original plugin will stay free but will not be updated.

If you wish to try out the plugin before buying, you can find the resource here:
[URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/venturacalendar-your-own-custom-calendar-1-13-1-18.94096/']VenturaCalendar | Your own custom calendar [1.13 - 1.18][/URL][/SIZE][/FONT]

[CENTER][IMG]https://i.imgur.com/TN49lsh.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://i.imgur.com/Jsbz4ga.png[/IMG]
[/CENTER]

[CENTER][ATTACH=full]677666[/ATTACH][/CENTER]
[LEFT][/LEFT]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Fully customizable events that take place on specified days, months;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Time synchronization (noon real-time - noon in-game);[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Highly customizable, simple & easy to use;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Time manipulation via commands;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]New day messages, titles, subtitles;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Simple configuration;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Custom placeholders;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]PlaceholderAPI support;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Daily rewards;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Configurable reward months and days;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Console and player sending commands for rewards;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Various actions additionally to command sending;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Automatic command execution on events or new days;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]Option to use real world time and have real-time calendar;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[*][FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=5]HEX color support;[/SIZE][/FONT]
[/LIST]
[CENTER][ATTACH=full]677665[/ATTACH][/CENTER]
[LEFT]
[FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=4]Base command & reload:[/SIZE]
[FONT=Book Antiqua][SIZE=4][B]/venturacalendar reload[/B]

Time manipulation:
[B]/venturacalendar <add/subtract><sec/min/h/d/weeks> <amount>[/B]

Set starting year without editing config:
[B]/venturacalendar set startyear <year>[/B]

Set the starting date in the config. (resets the world time)
[B]/venturacalendar set date <YYYY/MM/DD>[/B]

Calendar GUI command:
[B]/calendar[/B]
[/SIZE][/FONT]
[SIZE=4]Real-time calendar:
[B]/calendar realtime[/B][/SIZE][/FONT]

[/LEFT]
[CENTER][ATTACH=full]677664[/ATTACH][/CENTER]
[LEFT]
Permission to the base command:
[FONT=Book Antiqua][B]venturacalendar.command.venturacalendar[/B]

Permission to the reload the config:
[B]venturacalendar.command.reload:[/B]

Permission to open the calendar:
[B]venturacalendar.command.calendar[/B]

Permission to manipulate time using add/subtract/set:
[B]venturacalendar.command.changetime[/B]

[FONT=Book Antiqua]Permission to open real-time calendar:[/FONT]
[B][FONT=Book Antiqua][B]venturacalendar.command.calendar.realtime[/B][/FONT][/B]


You can find more information in the wiki:
[URL='https://github.com/M0diis/VenturaCalendar/wiki/Usage']Usage · M0diis/VenturaCalendar Wiki (github.com)[/URL]
 [/FONT][/LEFT]
[CENTER][ATTACH=full]677663[/ATTACH][/CENTER]

[FONT=Book Antiqua]There are multiple configuration files, most of the configuration is self explanatory and does not require a lot of understandment.

To setup the a Time System you should first understand what it does.
The Time System will be used to calculate the date, it provides information about the length of the different time units like seconds, minutes, hours, etc.

It also provides information about your eras and about the different names of the days and months, so it's the most important part of the configuration.[/FONT]

[FONT=Book Antiqua]For more information on configuration, go to VenturaCalendar Github wiki page:
[B][URL='https://github.com/M0diis/VenturaCalendar/wiki/Configuration']Configuration · M0diis/VenturaCalendar Wiki (github.com)[/URL] [/B][/FONT]


[CENTER][ATTACH=full]677662[/ATTACH][/CENTER]

[B][URL='https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/placeholderapi.6245/']PlaceholderAPI | [/URL]Optional[/B]

[CENTER][ATTACH=full]677667[/ATTACH][/CENTER]

